      <memberdef kind="function" id="class_quant_lib_1_1_settings_1a95055e9410ed0465a5f30d3ffc90c1d3" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="yes" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>DateProxy &amp;</type>
        <definition>Settings::DateProxy &amp; evaluationDate</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>evaluationDate</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>the date at which pricing is to be performed. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Client code can inspect the evaluation date, as in: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">Date<sp/>d<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_singleton_1ab7455b7e1235d292c444095842349291" kindref="member" tooltip="access to the unique instance">Settings::instance</ref>().<ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_settings_1a95055e9410ed0465a5f30d3ffc90c1d3" kindref="member" tooltip="the date at which pricing is to be performed.">evaluationDate</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> where today&apos;s date is returned if the evaluation date is set to the null date (its default value;) can set it to a new value, as in: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_singleton_1ab7455b7e1235d292c444095842349291" kindref="member" tooltip="access to the unique instance">Settings::instance</ref>().<ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_settings_1a95055e9410ed0465a5f30d3ffc90c1d3" kindref="member" tooltip="the date at which pricing is to be performed.">evaluationDate</ref>()<sp/>=<sp/>d;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> and can register with it, as in: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">registerWith(<ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_singleton_1ab7455b7e1235d292c444095842349291" kindref="member" tooltip="access to the unique instance">Settings::instance</ref>().<ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_settings_1a95055e9410ed0465a5f30d3ffc90c1d3" kindref="member" tooltip="the date at which pricing is to be performed.">evaluationDate</ref>());</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> to be notified when it is set to a new value. <xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000106"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>a notification is not sent when the evaluation date changes for natural causes<mdash/>i.e., a date was not explicitly set (which results in today&apos;s date being used for pricing) and the current date changes as the clock strikes midnight. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="C:/Develop/QuantLib-1.2.1/ql/settings.hpp" line="71" bodyfile="C:/Develop/QuantLib-1.2.1/ql/settings.hpp" bodystart="153" bodyend="155"/>
